which was running, and it finished.

4
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,660
And it actually matched the forecast.

5
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,340
So remember we were running this.

6
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:24,240
Each of these curves is essentially

7
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:28,720
IsoFLOPs curve, which is a bunch of smaller model runs.

8
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,980
And you try to find the compute optimal point.

9
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,400
You fit a scaling law.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:38,280
And this was the point where we predicted the loss,

11
